Image fixtures for the sway-image-* scenarios (see ../README.md),
generated with Pillow:

- gradient.jpg, gradient.webp: 48x48, red rising to the right and
  green downward over blue falling to the right, quality 90.
- gradient.tiff: the JPEG fixture resized to 32x32 and saved with LZW.
- frames.gif: three 24x24 frames on white, 100 ms each, looping: a red
  block at the top left, a green block at the top right and a blue
  block at the bottom.  The scenarios check these colors.
